.TH SPPDOCS-AUDIT-VERIFY 1 "September 2026" "SPP CLI Manual" "SPP System Documentation"
.SH NAME
sppdocs:audit:verify \- Verify cryptographic hash chain integrity of project audit logs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php sppdocs:audit:verify
[\fB\-\-project\fR=\fIproject-id\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sppdocs:audit:verify
performs cryptographic verification of all audit trail entries in audit_chain.jsonl for an SPPDocs project, validating SHA-256 Merkle links to ensure tamper-evident records.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-project= "project-id"
Target project ID. Default is demo-app.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Reads each line of audit_chain.jsonl, recalculates hash digests from genesis to tip, and reports verification success or specific tampered line index.
